  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Numun Fund was seeded in May 2020 as the first dedicated fund for feminist technology, focused on feminist activists in and from the global south. Numun&apos;s mission is mobilizing and redistributing diverse resources for a growing ecosystem of feminist tech activism. It strengthens the power of social justice movements and builds technology for the world we want. It is committed to shifting power and resources to feminist and women/trans-led groups, organizations, and networks that use technology to advance social justice organizing and achieve gender-just outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
